    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"x", "/.", 
      RowBox[{"var", "->", 
       RowBox[{"HalfCompactify", "[", 
        RowBox[{"s0", ",", "\[Phi]"}], "]"}]}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",\

